  "title": "Broccoli and Stilton Soup",
  "description": "This delicious puréed broccoli soup with Stilton cheese is easy to make with just six ingredients, including two potatoes for a thicker consistency.",
  "authors": [
    "Ann Maksymiw"
  ],
